  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Larger and faster defense aid shipments increase near‑term fuel consumption for military logistics and generate spot purchases (including forward cover), tightening available commercial volumes and lifting local/global spot diesel prices.</data>
