  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Heightened maritime security risk increases dealer inventory and funding risk, prompting wider quotes and reduced willingness to absorb large sovereign bond trades, thereby reducing market depth.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_middle_east_tension</data>
  <data key="d40">sovereign_bond_market_st</data>
