  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating shipping risk drives abrupt asset-price moves and margin calls on commodity and cross‑asset positions, triggering faster forced deleveraging and higher leverage unwind rates in the sovereign bond complex.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_middle_east_tension</data>
  <data key="d40">sovereign_bond_market_st</data>
</edge>
