  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in attacks/interdictions on ships transiting the Gulf and Suez raises insurance costs, forces rerouting and port delays, and disrupts timely delivery of GPUs, networking gear and fabrication inputs, causing cloud providers and hyperscalers to postpone or reduce bring‑online of compute capacity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
