  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Changes in benchmark crude prices feed directly into refinery input costs and short-term product pricing formulas, causing diesel spot prices to move in the same direction within weeks as refiners and traders repriced cargoes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
