  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter export controls and enforcement by the US/allies prompt China to accelerate clandestine or state-facilitated transfers of dual-use AI-enabled systems and combat drones to Iran, materially improving Iranian or proxy strike capabilities and thereby increasing the frequency/severity of military incidents in the region.</data>
