  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising sovereign nominal yields raise refinancing and working‑capital costs for refiners, traders and shipping firms (and increase trade finance spreads), which operators pass through as higher delivered diesel prices in spot markets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">sovereign_bond_market_st</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
