  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising nominal government bond yields raise borrowing costs and fiscal strain for donor governments, causing them to delay, scale back, or ration cash‑intensive military aid packages and credits to Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">sovereign_bond_market_st</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
