  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Deeper bond‑market liquidity eases access to short‑term collateral and repo funding used to finance tank storage and floating storage contracts, enabling traders to hold larger diesel inventories; the reverse (liquidity drying up) forces inventory drawdowns.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">sovereign_bond_market_st</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
