  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Spikes in bond‑market volatility force higher margining and haircuts for commodity traders and brokers, reducing hedging capacity and liquidity in physical/diesel futures markets and producing short‑term upward pressure and larger swings in diesel spot prices.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-3 months</data>
  <data key="d39">sovereign_bond_market_st</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
</edge>
