  <data key="d29">1</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Spikes in sovereign‑market volatility concentrate political and bureaucratic attention on systemic risks, prompting faster issuance and tighter enforcement of export controls, investment screening, and sectoral oversight affecting US–China tech/trade flows.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">sovereign_bond_market_st</data>
